OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan says he faced death threat to
OL,4,Asteal #137k watch
OL,5,
OL,6,FBotezatu had been smoking a cigar on
OL,7,Fthe terrace of the restaurant Amazonico
OL,8,Fin Berkeley Square on 28 January and
OL,9,Fshortly before midnight his Richard
OL,10,FMille watch was cut from his wrist,
OL,11,FSouthwark Crown Court heard.
OL,13,FEldahouzze and El Habchi each deny one
OL,14,Fcount of robbery.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
